Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(fsdpturbo): add backend entry, Qwen3 model loading
 and FSDP2 numerical validation

Introduce the FSDPTurbo backend entry with an isolated Ray training actor,
conservative Qwen3 checkpoint loading, native FSDP2 wrapping through
FSDPTurbo, and two-rank numerical validation. Model loading and wrapping stay
lazy to preserve the serving interpreter.
